WEBVTT

00:03:28.379 --> 00:03:30.863
To publish them
for a wider reach and impact,

00:03:30.887 --> 00:03:34.037
we have partnered
with 16 leading media houses,

00:03:34.061 --> 00:03:35.768
who are happy to take them,

00:03:35.792 --> 00:03:40.457
as it brings their cost down,
by not editing or managing reporters.

00:03:40.847 --> 00:03:46.233
Today, we have more
than 1,200 reporters in our network,

00:03:46.257 --> 00:03:48.894
covering stories
like the nuclear power plant,

00:03:48.918 --> 00:03:52.062
from places that are either ignored
by mainstream media

00:03:52.086 --> 00:03:53.264
or never covered.

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:55.542
In the next five years,

00:03:55.566 --> 00:04:01.566
we plan to have one reporter in each
of the 5,500 subdistricts in India,